IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DEEPSEEK-MTP.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-DRAFT-HEADS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 THRESH-PCT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DEEPSEEK-MTP.
    IF NUM-DRAFT-HEADS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 574200 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    MOVE 320 TO SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-DRAFT-HEADS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
